<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps to form Singapore venture.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps to form Singapore venture.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said on Friday that it agreed to form a Singapore-based joint venture with Rating Agency Malaysia Berhad that will rate Southeast Asian foreign and local currency debt.</p>
<p>The new firm, which will be jointly owned by Duff &amp; Phelps Credit and Rating Agency Malaysia Berhad, will work with issuers in Singapore, Malaysia, Indonesia, Thailand, Philippines and other countries in the region.</p>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps provides ratings and research on corporate, structured and sovereign financings issued around the world.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
